OL,3,ABoys, 12 and 14, arrested on suspicion
OL,4,Aof arson after major city centre fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo boys, 12 and 14, have been arrested
OL,7,Fon suspicion of arson after a large
OL,8,Ffire at a "residential property" in
OL,9,FMarket Street
OL,11,FAt 22:55 BST on Monday night,
OL,12,FNottinghamshire Fire and Rescue Service
OL,13,Fsaid 12 fire engines were at the scene
OL,15,FA fire commander told BBC Nottingham
OL,16,Fthe blaze - in the Escobar building -
OL,17,Fspread to the roof
OL,19,FNo injuries have been reported,
OL,20,Faccording to the fire service
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
