OL,3,ABoys, 12 and 14, arrested on suspicion
OL,4,Aof arson after major city centre fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FA number of roads were closed while
OL,7,Ffirefighters dealt with the blaze, but
OL,8,Fhave since reopened, with traffic
OL,9,Frestrict to one lane
OL,11,FTrams are unable to run through the
OL,12,Fcity centre
OL,14,FA joint police and fire investigation
OL,15,Finto the cause of the blaze is under
OL,16,Fway
OL,18,FAn incident commander said there was
OL,19,F"quite significant damage" to the
OL,20,Fbuilding
